      description:
        'This enables filtering of noise and background speech while the user is talking.\n\nFeatures:\n- Smart denoising using Krisp\n- Fourier denoising\n\nSmart denoising can be combined with or used independently of Fourier denoising.\n\nOrder of precedence:\n- Smart denoising\n- Fourier denoising',
